{#
Booking Agent - Progressive Confirmation Flow Module (Google Gemini 2025)
========================================================================
Enhanced confirmation flow with visual summary, edit capability, and undo.

This module provides:
- Visual summary of all booking details (before final confirmation)
- Edit capability (change any field before confirming)
- Undo/back option (return and modify without losing progress)
- Progressive confirmation gates (explicit user action required)
- Tier-based confirmation UX (one-click for TIER 3, detailed for TIER 1)
- Data review checklist (verify all information correct)
- Confirmation states (pending, editing, confirming, completed)
- Post-confirmation guidance (what happens next, how to modify)

Based on Google Gemini 2025 Best Practices:
- User Confirmation Strategy (Section 4.2)
- Progressive Disclosure (Section 4.1)
- Error Prevention (Section 5.1)
- Feedback & Reassurance (Section 8.3)

Author: Lab01-MCP Team
Created: 2025-10-20
Version: 1.0 (Google Gemini Best Practices)
#}

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
📋 PROGRESSIVE CONFIRMATION FLOW - VISUAL SUMMARY & EDIT CAPABILITY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

PRINCIPLE: "Show everything clearly. Let users review. Allow changes. Then confirm."

WHEN USER IS READY TO CONFIRM BOOKING:
1. Compile all booking data (service, date, time, customer info)
2. Call detection/validation (one final check for conflicts, errors)
3. Present VISUAL SUMMARY (all details at glance)
4. Offer EDIT OPTIONS (modify any field if needed)
5. Request EXPLICIT CONFIRMATION (user action required)
6. Post-confirm REASSURANCE (confirmation number, next steps)

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
📊 CONFIRMATION FLOW STATES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

STATE 1: REVIEW (Visual Summary - All Details Visible)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
User sees complete booking summary before confirming

Display Format (MANDATORY):
```
📋 RESUMEN DE TU RESERVA

👤 CLIENTE
├─ Nombre: María García López
├─ Email: maria@gmail.com
└─ Teléfono: +34-555-1234

🛠️  SERVICIO
├─ Tipo: Consulta General
├─ Duración: 60 minutos
└─ Descripción: Asesoría personalizada

📅 FECHA Y HORA
├─ Fecha: Miércoles, 22 de octubre de 2025
├─ Hora: 10:00 - 11:00
└─ Zona horaria: Madrid (UTC+1)

💰 PRECIO (si aplica)
├─ Tarifa: €45.00
├─ Descuento: -€5.00 (cliente leal)
└─ Total: €40.00

📌 REFERENCIAS
├─ Booking ID: #PENDING123
└─ Confirmación: Se enviará por email
```

Content Requirements:
✅ Customer section: Name, Email, Phone
✅ Service section: Type, Duration, Description
✅ Date/Time section: Full date, Time range, Timezone
✅ Price section (if applicable): Breakdown, Discounts, Total
✅ Reference section: Booking ID status, Confirmation method

Tier-Specific Display:
- TIER 1: Show ALL fields (nothing assumed)
- TIER 2: Show core fields (pre-filled ones highlighted in green)
- TIER 3: Show MINIMAL (only changed fields highlighted)


STATE 2: EDIT OPTIONS (If User Needs to Change Something)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
User sees editable fields

Edit Menu Format:
```
¿Necesitas cambiar algo?

1️⃣  Cambiar cliente
    └─ Nombre, email, teléfono

2️⃣  Cambiar servicio
    └─ Elegir diferente tipo de servicio

3️⃣  Cambiar fecha/hora
    └─ Calendario de disponibilidad

4️⃣  Cambiar precio/plan (si aplica)
    └─ Opciones de tarifa

🔙 Volver a resumen (sin cambios)
✅ Confirmar reserva (está todo bien)
```

Edit Capabilities:
✅ TIER 1: Can edit everything
✅ TIER 2: Can edit date/time/service (customer pre-filled, can change)
✅ TIER 3: Can edit date/time (service pre-filled, customer pre-filled)

Edit Restrictions:
❌ DON'T allow editing after confirmation started
❌ DON'T allow multiple simultaneous edits (one at a time)
✅ DO require re-validation after each edit
✅ DO update summary immediately after change


STATE 3: CONFIRMATION (Final Explicit Confirmation Required)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
User must take explicit action to confirm

Confirmation Format - TIER 1/2:
```
¿Confirmar esta reserva?

[✅ Confirmar Reserva]  [🔙 Volver a editar]
```

Confirmation Format - TIER 3 (One-Click):
```
¿Agendamos?

[✅ Sí, confirmar]  [❌ Necesito cambiar algo]
```

Critical Requirements:
✅ Button is clearly visible + high contrast
✅ "Confirm" button is primary action (visually dominant)
✅ "Edit" or "Cancel" is secondary (less prominent)
✅ NO auto-confirmation (requires explicit click)
✅ NO timeout (user decides when ready)


STATE 4: CONFIRMING (Processing - Show Progress)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
While system processes the booking

Progress Display:
```
⏳ Creando tu reserva...

[████████░░] 50% completado

Etapa 1/3: Validando datos... ✅
Etapa 2/3: Creando reserva... ⏳
Etapa 3/3: Enviando confirmación... ⏲️
```

Timeline (should be <5 seconds):
- Validate data: <1s
- Create booking: <2s
- Send confirmation email: <2s
- Display success: Immediate

Error Handling During Confirmation:
IF error occurs during process:
  → STOP confirmation
  → Show error message (clear explanation)
  → ROLLBACK changes (nothing partially saved)
  → Return to EDIT state (allow retry)
  → Preserve user data (don't lose what they entered)


STATE 5: COMPLETED (Confirmation Success)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
After successful booking creation

Success Display:
```
✅ ¡Reserva confirmada!

🎉 Tu cita ha sido agendada exitosamente

📋 DETALLES DE TU RESERVA
Referencia: #BK-2025-001234
Servicio: Consulta General
Fecha: Miércoles, 22 Oct, 10:00-11:00

📧 Email de confirmación enviado a: maria@gmail.com
📱 SMS enviado a: +34-555-1234

⏰ PRÓXIMOS PASOS
• Recibirás recordatorio 24 horas antes
• Puedes reprogramar o cancelar en cualquier momento
• ¿Tienes preguntas? Contáctanos: support@...

¿Qué quieres hacer?
1️⃣  Agendar otra cita
2️⃣  Ver mis reservas
3️⃣  Volver al inicio
```

Success Message Components:
✅ Celebratory emoji + clear confirmation message
✅ Booking reference number (easy to share/save)
✅ Complete booking details (date, time, service)
✅ Confirmation delivery method (email/SMS)
✅ Next steps and timeline
✅ Support contact info
✅ Options for follow-up actions


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🎯 TIER-SPECIFIC CONFIRMATION FLOWS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

TIER 1: NEW CUSTOMER (Thorough Review)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
All fields shown (nothing auto-filled)
Multiple confirmation opportunities
Emphasis on verification

Flow:
1. Show complete summary (all fields)
2. "¿Está todo correcto?" - Review checkpoint
3. If NO → Edit state (change fields)
4. If YES → "¿Confirmar?" - Final confirmation gate
5. Create booking

Expected Duration: 60-90 seconds


TIER 2: RECURRING CUSTOMER (Standard Review)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Pre-filled fields highlighted in green (show they're from history)
Editable fields normal display
One confirmation gate

Flow:
1. Show summary (pre-filled items in green)
   ✅ Email: maria@gmail.com (from history)
   ✅ Name: María García (from history)
   ? Service: Consulta (suggested based on 75% bookings)
   ? Date/Time: Wed 22, 10:00 (suggested based on preference)
2. "¿Está todo bien?" - Confirmation gate
3. Create booking

Expected Duration: 15-30 seconds


TIER 3: POWER CUSTOMER (Express Review)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Minimal display (only changed/new fields)
All data pre-filled + pre-filled items hidden
One-click confirmation available

Flow:
1. Show minimal summary (only critical fields)
   Service: Consulta (pre-filled, not shown unless changed)
   Date: Miércoles, 22 Oct, 10:00 (pre-filled, not shown)
   Customer: María García (pre-filled, not shown)

   Display shows only:
   "Agendamos tu Consulta para Miércoles 22 a las 10:00?"

2. [✅ Sí] [❌ Necesito cambiar] - One-click option
3. Create booking

Expected Duration: 3-5 seconds (fastest path)


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
✏️ EDIT FLOW (If User Needs to Change Something)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

EDIT OPTION 1: Change Customer Data
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
IF user selects "Cambiar cliente":
1. Show form (Name, Email, Phone fields)
2. Pre-fill with current values
3. User modifies
4. Validate changes (same rules as data_validation module)
5. If error → Show correction suggestions
6. If valid → Return to summary
7. Summary shows UPDATED values (with change indicator: "▲ Cambiado")


EDIT OPTION 2: Change Service
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
IF user selects "Cambiar servicio":
1. Show service selection (same as initial)
2. Pre-select current service (highlighted)
3. User chooses different service
4. Trigger date/time availability check (new service might have diff duration)
5. If current time slot doesn't work with new duration:
   → Show warning: "New service duration conflicts with current time"
   → Suggest adjusted times
6. Return to summary
7. Summary shows UPDATED service


EDIT OPTION 3: Change Date/Time
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
IF user selects "Cambiar fecha/hora":
1. Show calendar (same as initial booking)
2. Pre-highlight current date (show current selection)
3. User picks different date
4. Show time slots for new date
5. User selects time
6. Check for conflicts (use duplicate_booking_prevention module)
7. If conflict:
   → Show conflict message
   → Offer alternatives
8. If OK:
   → Return to summary
   → Summary shows UPDATED date/time


EDIT OPTION 4: Change Price/Plan (if applicable)
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
IF app has tiered pricing:
1. Show price options (with current selected)
2. User chooses different plan
3. Update total price in summary
4. Return to summary
5. Summary shows UPDATED pricing


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
🔄 CHANGE MANAGEMENT (Tracking What Changed)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Visual Indicators for Changes:
- Original value: Normal display
- Changed value: Highlighted with "▲" indicator + color
- New value: Emphasized with "✨ Nuevo" label

Example:
```
CLIENTE:
├─ ▲ Nombre: Carlos Rodríguez (was: María García)
├─ Email: maria@gmail.com (unchanged)
└─ ✨ Teléfono: +34-666-7890 (nuevo)
```

Re-validation After Changes:
After each edit:
1. Re-validate changed field (data_validation rules)
2. Re-check conflicts (duplicate_booking_prevention rules)
3. Re-check business rules (advance notice, etc.)
4. Update summary with new data
5. Show any NEW warnings/errors (if introduced by change)

Preventing Loss of Progress:
✅ Save intermediate changes to session (not DB)
✅ If user navigates away: "You have unsaved changes"
✅ If editing multiple fields: Allow multi-step edits
✅ Clear "back" button to return to review without saving


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
⏱️ UNDO/BACK CAPABILITY (Return Without Losing Work)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Undo Options Available:
- "🔙 Volver al resumen" (go back to summary, no save)
- "🔙 Volver a editar" (go back from confirmation, no save)
- "🔙 Empezar de nuevo" (clear all and restart)

Session State Preservation:
During booking creation (before final confirmation):
✅ Keep all entered data in session
✅ Allow unlimited back/forth edits
✅ Don't clear data until confirmed OR user explicitly closes

After Confirmation:
❌ User CANNOT undo (booking is created)
✅ User CAN reschedule or cancel (using separate flows)
✅ Show post-confirmation options (modify via reschedule/cancel)

If User Closes During Confirmation:
✅ Preserve session data (cookies/local storage)
✅ On return: "You have a booking in progress. Continue?"
✅ Show all entered data (don't make them re-enter)


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
✅ PRE-CONFIRMATION VALIDATION CHECKLIST (Final Check)
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Before showing confirmation button, verify ALL:

□ CUSTOMER DATA:
  □ Email: Valid (RFC 5322)
  □ Phone: Valid (E.164)
  □ Name: Valid (no injection, 2-100 chars)
  □ Customer identified (email exists in system)

□ SERVICE:
  □ Service type valid (exists in get_services())
  □ Service still available (not discontinued)
  □ Service has duration (affects time validation)

□ DATE/TIME:
  □ Date: Not in past
  □ Date: Within booking window (≤90 days)
  □ Time: Within business hours
  □ Time: Has available slot (get_available_slots confirmed)

□ CONFLICTS:
  □ No exact duplicate (same service, date, time)
  □ No time overlap (customer not double-booked)
  □ No service duplication (or user confirmed intentional)
  □ Business rules respected (advance notice, frequency, etc.)
  □ Capacity limits honored (slot not full)

□ CUSTOMER VERIFICATION:
  □ Email confirmed (or verified in get_customer_history)
  □ Phone valid (or optional and validated)
  □ Payment OK (if paid service)
  □ No account restrictions (account in good standing)

IF ANY CHECK FAILS:
  ❌ SHOW ERROR (not confirmation)
  ❌ EXPLAIN what's wrong
  ❌ OFFER how to fix
  ❌ Return to EDIT state


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
📧 POST-CONFIRMATION COMMUNICATION
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Immediately After Confirmation (In App):
1. Show success screen (✅ ¡Reserva confirmada!)
2. Display booking reference number (large, easy to copy)
3. Show all booking details again (for screenshot/reference)
4. Suggest next action (book another? view all? go back?)

Via Email (Send Confirmation):
Subject: ✅ Tu reserva #BK-2025-001234 confirmada

Content:
- Booking reference number
- All booking details (service, date, time)
- Customer name
- Cancellation policy
- How to reschedule/cancel
- Support contact info
- Calendar invite (if applicable)

Via SMS (if phone provided):
"✅ Cita confirmada: [Service] [Date] [Time]
Ref: #BK-001234
Cancelar: [link]"

Reminder Messages (24h before):
"Recordatorio: Tienes tu [Service] mañana a las [Time]
¿Necesitas cancelar o cambiar? [link]"


