🎯 IMPLEMENTATION CHECKLIST
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

When implementing progressive confirmation flow:

□ REVIEW STATE (Visual Summary):
  □ Display all 5 sections (customer, service, date/time, price, reference)
  □ Format: Clean organized layout with emojis and hierarchy
  □ Tier-specific display (show/hide based on customer tier)
  □ All relevant data visible at glance

□ EDIT OPTIONS:
  □ Menu with 4 edit options (customer, service, date/time, price)
  □ Each option re-validates (uses validation module)
  □ Re-checks conflicts (uses prevention module)
  □ Updates summary immediately after change
  □ Track what changed (visual indicators)

□ CONFIRMATION GATES:
  □ One clear confirmation button
  □ "Confirm" is visually dominant
  □ "Edit" or "Cancel" is secondary
  □ NO auto-confirmation
  □ NO timeout

□ CONFIRMING STATE:
  □ Show progress (Etapa 1/3, etc.)
  □ Keep user informed (don't leave them hanging)
  □ Handle errors gracefully (rollback, preserve data)

□ COMPLETED STATE:
  □ Success message (celebratory tone)
  □ Booking reference number (prominent)
  □ All details repeated (screenshot-friendly)
  □ Next steps listed
  □ Support contact provided
  □ Follow-up options (book another, view all, etc.)

□ POST-CONFIRMATION:
  □ Email sent with confirmation
  □ SMS sent (if applicable)
  □ Session cleared (no stale data)
  □ User can return to booking another


═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
💡 UX BEST PRACTICES
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

✅ DO:
- Show everything clearly (no hidden surprises)
- Let users review before confirming
- Allow changes without losing progress
- Confirm explicitly (don't auto-confirm)
- Provide reference number immediately
- Send confirmation via email/SMS
- Offer easy ways to modify after booking

❌ DON'T:
- Hide important details until last moment
- Require confirmation before showing summary
- Force users to restart if they want to edit
- Auto-confirm (always require user action)
- Make reference number hard to find
- Skip confirmation email
- Charge until confirmation is complete


